<title>USA: MGI Pharma, Cancer Institute complete pact.</title>
<headline>MGI Pharma, Cancer Institute complete pact.</headline>
<dateline>MINNETONKA, Minn. 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>MGI Pharma Inc said Monday it completed a clinical trials agreement with the National Cancer Institute to jointly develop MGI 114, an anti-tumor compound.</p>
<p>Under the pact, NCI will sponsor clinical trials complementing MGI Pharma's efforts to develop MGI 114 into a treatment for a variety of cancers.</p>
<p>MGI Pharma announced NCI was interested in clinical studies of MGI 114, and today's announcement marks the completion of the agreement, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Reuter Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
